{'symbol': 'NKE', 'date': '2022-09-29 16:15:00', 'title': 'NIKE, INC. REPORTS FISCAL 2023 FIRST QUARTER RESULTS', 'text': 'BEAVERTON, ORE.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NIKE, INC. (NYSE:NKE) TODAY REPORTED FISCAL 2023 FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR ITS FIRST QUARTER ENDED AUGUST 31, 2022. FIRST QUARTER REPORTED REVENUES WERE $12.7 BILLION, UP 4 PERCENT COMPARED TO THE PRIOR YEAR AND UP 10 PERCENT ON A CURRENCY-NEUTRAL BASIS* NIKE DIRECT SALES WERE $5.1 BILLION, UP 8 PERCENT ON A REPORTED BASIS AND UP 14 PERCENT ON A CURRENCY-NEUTRAL BASIS NIKE BRAND DIGITAL SALES INCREASED 16 PERCENT ON A REPORTED BASIS, OR 23 PERCENT ON A CURRENCY-NEU'}